{"root":{"data":{"id":"dif904ui4qo0","created":1778441801761,"text":"Game Rift"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif9859df2w0","created":1778442429573,"text":"CourseTransition","expandState":"expand","layout_right_offset":{"x":-35.99999999999977,"y":-18.666666666666686},"layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif8a0qs2hk0","created":1778439755360,"text":"Godot","layout":null,"background":"#7030a0","color":"white"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif8abewpnk0","created":1778439778587,"text":"How to Create a 3D Survival Game in Godot 4.2 with GDScript","progress":1,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dif8acqd6rc0","created":1778439781457,"text":"Blender","layout":null,"expandState":"expand","background":"#7030a0","color":"white"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif8ayc3khc0","created":1778439828483,"text":"Blender  Ultimate Game Art Creation Guide","progress":1,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dif8ilthgj40","created":1778440428150,"text":"Blender  Ultimate Game Art Creation Guide","progress":1,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dif8wvcfihs0","created":1778441545985,"text":"Alive! Animation course in Blender","progress":1,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dif8agzw6sg0","created":1778439790740,"text":"Sounds","layout":null,"background":"#7030a0","color":"white"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif8c0d7kbc0","created":1778439911268,"text":"Game Audio Essentials Music Production for Video Games","layout":null,"progress":1,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dif8c6i3c800","created":1778439924624,"text":"Game Audio Essentials SFX & Sound Design For Video Games","progress":1,"layout":null,"background":"transparent"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dif99h5pa280","created":1778442533837,"text":"GameDev"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dif9bhshy1s0","created":1778442691944,"text":"Youtube","background":"#92d050"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"difw3jd3tmo0","created":1778506953981,"text":"用 Godot 制作的神级 3D 角色控制器，这将是我们的 ALS！","expandState":"expand","hyperlink":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIf5YQ8qJng&t=52s","hyperlinkTitle":"atnda","note":"God Tier 3D Character Controller Made In Godot, this will be our ALS!\n\n\n   • Godot animation layering pipelines for big...  \n   • Roll dodge, shield block and finite spells...  \nIf somehow you are a new viewer and have no idea what happens, check this one out, I have a 1.25h tutorial series, you are in for a good time:\n   • Use professional AAA practices in your God...  \n\nCheck out our discord, once in a while a wizard appears there and randomly cuts you main frame execution times by half!\n  / discord  \n\nYou can also support the channel on patreon ^_^:\n  / fairfight  \n\nAlso the guy who provides animations makes some awesome 3d tools, check them out!\nhttps://linktr.ee/notthatnda\n\n\n00:00 Why you want to cut your legs\n02:45 Base(d) system\n10:53 Short classes review\n12:42 Final leap to godhood\n14:40 How to refactor public project into this","background":"transparent","progress":2},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"difyce3go280","created":1778513290011,"text":"Godot 4 自定义检查器插件","hyperlink":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xa6YBcrrS7E&t=19s","hyperlinkTitle":"","note":"Custom Inspector Plugins Godot 4\n\n学习如何使用检查器插件完全自定义 Godot 检查器。\n\n利用检查器插件释放 Godot 编辑器的强大功能，彻底改变您的游戏制作工作流程。\n\n自定义特殊类检查器，改善您的体验，改变其信息显示方式和交互方式。\n\n································································································\n\n想支持我吗？\n\n🌐 Patreon：/octodemy\n\n🌐项目源文件：/156854028\n\n·················································································\n\n#godot4 #godot #godotengine\n\n#godot4.6 #godotinspector #godoteditor #godot3d\n\n章节：\n\n0:00 简介\n\n0:15 检查器插件\n\n3:40 EditorProperty 类\n\n7:22 警告\n\n7:43 示例 1：生命条和属性更改监听器\n\n9:17 示例 2：3D 场景","progress":1},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"classic","version":"1.4.43"}